      <div class="teaser-card">
        <div class="teaser-num">The tools</div>
        <div class="teaser-name">Frameworks you can actually use</div>
        <div class="teaser-desc">Pre-mortems, decision matrices, steelmanning, hypothesis testing, and the outside view all reduce reliance on intuition in situations where intuition is known to be unreliable. Each tool targets a different failure mode.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

